Id: dns006f
Severity: FAIL
Category: network
Check: check_dns
Fix: Allow localhost and the local networks only.
References: named.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 4.8; NIST SC-5, SC-7; ISO 8.20; CE Firewalls

Bind answers recursion to anyone: an allow-recursion list holds 'any',
directly or through a named ACL. An open resolver serves the whole
Internet, including spoofed queries that turn it into an amplifier
for denial-of-service attacks against others.
